{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"archfiend","model_identifier":"archfiend","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# archfiend\n\nArchfiend (C3), walker, 3.2 m = 114 u to the top of the helm (horns to 124 u, banner finial to 128 u).\n\nA purple demon general in black-and-violet plate with plate-line highlights and glowing violet seams, a black helm over a gaunt violet face with burning violet eyes, huge black horns sweeping back, spiked pauldrons, a silver belt, a torn violet banner with a black pole and crossbar on its back (`banner` > `banner_cloth`), and a two-handed black greatsword with violet glowing edges. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled 1.9).\n\n- Cubes: 49 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -25.0..25.0, y 0.0..143.0, z -9.5..27.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 44 x 116 x 26 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.25 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `attack_cleave` | 1.5 | once | key 0.7 s: great two-handed diagonal cleave, high right to low left (hits an arc ~120 degrees, reach 80 u) |\n| `command` | 2.2 | once | sword raised to the sky, left arm sweeping at the enemy (rally / buff allies), 0.45-1.7 s |\n| `summon` | 2.6 | once | key 0.95 s: the sword is driven into the ground in front (summon the minions); held kneeling to 1.9, wrenched free |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | levels the sword at the target |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 (sword lies flat) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 1.25 s, 57.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 120.9 u/s (3.40 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 96.7 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_cleave`: key 0.7 s: great two-handed diagonal cleave, high right to low left (hits an arc ~120 degrees, reach 80 u)\n- `summon`: key 0.95 s: the sword is driven into the ground in front (summon the minions); held kneeling to 1.9, wrenched free\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 115, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 79.5, 9.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (6.5, 87, 9.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (11, 96.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 76, -9.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (17, 52.25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-22.5, 65.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-17, 52.25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (12, 56, 6.25)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-12, 56, 6.25)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `greatsword` (visible, under slot_hand_r): two-handed sword, blade 54 u (1.5 m), grip at the origin, blade along -Z, edge along Y; the left hand grips 6.5 u nearer the pommel\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_seam_* and glow_sword_edge* are the lit cubes.\n"},"description":"# archfiend\n\nArchfiend (C3), walker, 3.2 m = 114 u to the top of the helm (horns to 124 u, banner finial to 128 u).\n\nA purple demon general in black-and-violet plate with plate-line highlights and glowing violet seams, a black helm over a gaunt violet face with burning violet eyes, huge black horns sweeping back, spiked pauldrons, a silver belt, a torn violet banner with a black pole and crossbar on its back (`banner` > `banner_cloth`), and a two-handed black greatsword with violet glowing edges. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled 1.9).\n\n- Cubes: 49 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 256x256, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -25.0..25.0, y 0.0..143.0, z -9.5..27.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 44 x 116 x 26 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3.6 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 1.25 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 0.8 | loop |  |\n| `attack_cleave` | 1.5 | once | key 0.7 s: great two-handed diagonal cleave, high right to low left (hits an arc ~120 degrees, reach 80 u) |\n| `command` | 2.2 | once | sword raised to the sky, left arm sweeping at the enemy (rally / buff allies), 0.45-1.7 s |\n| `summon` | 2.6 | once | key 0.95 s: the sword is driven into the ground in front (summon the minions); held kneeling to 1.9, wrenched free |\n| `aggro` | 1.4 | once | levels the sword at the target |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch |\n| `death` | 2 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 (sword lies flat) |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 46.2 u/s (1.30 m/s), cycle 1.25 s, 57.8 u per cycle\n- `run`: 120.9 u/s (3.40 m/s), cycle 0.8 s, 96.7 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_cleave`: key 0.7 s: great two-handed diagonal cleave, high right to low left (hits an arc ~120 degrees, reach 80 u)\n- `summon`: key 0.95 s: the sword is driven into the ground in front (summon the minions); held kneeling to 1.9, wrenched free\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 115, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 79.5, 9.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (6.5, 87, 9.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (11, 96.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 76, -9.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (17, 52.25, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-22.5, 65.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-17, 52.25, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (12, 56, 6.25)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-12, 56, 6.25)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `greatsword` (visible, under slot_hand_r): two-handed sword, blade 54 u (1.5 m), grip at the origin, blade along -Z, edge along Y; the left hand grips 6.5 u nearer the pommel\n\n## Notes\n\n- glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_seam_* and glow_sword_edge* are the lit cubes.\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-11.0,53.0,-6.75],"to":[11.0,62.5,6.75],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,53.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[102,112,124.0,121.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[146,112,159.5,121.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[124,112,146.0,121.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[160,112,173.5,121.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[76,97,98.0,110.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[98,97,120.0,110.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"5fd88090-4de1-5f57-b452-b7f9d9a97d85"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-15.0,62.5,-8.0],"to":[15.0,95.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,62.5,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16,0,46.0,32.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[76,0,92.0,32.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[46,0,76.0,32.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[92,0,108.0,32.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,81,30.0,97.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[30,81,60.0,97.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7e903353-c84d-58ea-b78b-93f72f01c621"},{"name":"neck","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.75,95.0,-3.75],"to":[3.75,99.0,3.75],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,95.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[30,148,37.5,152.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[38,148,45.5,152.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[46,148,53.5,152.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[54,148,61.5,152.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[116,126,123.5,133.5],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[124,126,131.5,133.5],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1116855b-6dd9-57ff-97f0-a9e41daed521"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,99.0,-7.0]